      "category": "passive",
      "placement": "mid",
      "activity": null,
      "traits": [
        "aura",
        "plant",
        "primal",
        "transmutation"
      ],
      "entries": [
        "120 feet. Plants near Dimari-Diji grow larger and more vibrant. Plants in the emanation gain the success effects of the plant growth ritual. Any plant spells cast in the area are empowered and use the effects of the spell 1 level higher than it was cast, to a maximum of 9th level (Dimari-Diji's spells are unaffected). Finally, other plant creatures gain fast healing 20 while in the area."
      ],
      "aura": {
        "range": 120,
        "unit": "ft"
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "Enriching Aura",
      "category": "passive",
      "placement": "mid",
      "activity": null,
      "traits": [
        "aura",
        "evocation",
        "transmutation"
      ],
      "entries": [
        "60 feet. Dimari-Diji's natural power enhances primal spellcasting around him. All creatures within the emanation can alter a primal spell as if they had just used Reach Spell or Widen Spell when they Cast the Spell."
